WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.710
I'll have Judge Devil attack Umbral!

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.710
Thi-... this is...

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.240
That feeling... just what...?

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.170
<i>His Highness, Prince Vector, has truly been born on a fated day!</i>

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.770
<i>He is an incarnation of our God, a symbol of peace!</i>

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:39.680
<i>Master Vector! - Master Vector! - Master Vector!</i>

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.570
<i>Peace... what a load of crap.</i>

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:59.280
<i>Snatch their riches and power by any means necessary!</i>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.370
<i>Sally forth!</i>

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.390
<i>Take all and everything!</i>

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.390
<i>Everything and anything no matter what!</i>

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.690
<i>Fight! Fight on!</i>

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:21.110
<i>The king... the king has fallen!</i>

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:26.240
<i>You father, the King, cannot get up any more.</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:30.910
<i>Now you can save this country, you are the only one who can.</i>

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.280
<i>I'm begging you, Vector...</i>

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:35.220
<i>Of course, my mother.</i>

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.820
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.950
<i>I do not like fighting.</i>

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:49.110
<i>I sincerely desire to see you, the people of our land, live in peace and happiness.</i>

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:53.420
<i>Everyone, let us work together to build a brighter tomorrow!</i>

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.420
<i>Wha... what did you say, you brat!?</i>

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:09.530
<i>That you signed a peace treaty with our enemies!?</i>

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:10.950
<i>Yes.</i>

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.270
<i>You moron! You damn stupid moron!</i>

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.550
<i>Just one more step...</i>

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:20.350
<i>...and those neighboring countries would have been part of </i>this Kingdom<i>!</i>

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.110
<i>But, father!</i>

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.530
<i>I cannot bear to see any more people die on the battlefield!</i>

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:28.000
<i>You shut up!</i>

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.970
<i>Why... Just why... this "Symbol of Peace", why this imbecile brat,</i>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.710
<i>sired by my loins!</i>

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.170
<i>Father...</i>

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:40.110
<i>You damn brat must have been born to drag my glory into the dirt,</i>

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.000
<i>you have to be a cursed child!</i>

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:48.060
<i>Cowards! They have to die! Like YOU!</i>

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.350
<i>Father!</i>

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.760
<i>Mother!</i>

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.750
<i>Mother!</i>

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:04.910
<i>Your majesty, I shall not let you lay a hand on our child.</i>

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.460
<i>Shu... Shut up!</i>

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.460
<i>Father! Mother!</i>

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:15.460
<i>Vector.</i>

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.240
<i>Who... who are you?</i>

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.290
<i>You shall not be the prince of tragedy...</i>

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.180
<i>... you shall become the prince of madness!</i>

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:32.130
<i>The same cruel blood as of this King's is running through you.</i>

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:39.110
<i>By awakening it, you will become the power of my ambitions.</i>

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.750
<i>I killed my father and mother... I am the cruel prince...</i>

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.730
<i>To turn this world into a sea of blood...</i>

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.000
<i>... is why I was born...!</i>

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:55.450
{marker}

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:59.630
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:04.870
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.560
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:20.740
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.560
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:31.540
the feelings I want to express.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:40.560
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.810
Right now, with you

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.740
Oh - By facing each other,

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:54.820
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:59.920
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:05.350
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:10.520
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:20.100
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.810
Tho- those were Vector's...

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.560
...true Memories...!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:37.190
<i>"Vector's Trifling!
Bonds of Trapped Friendship!!"</i>

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.140
Just like the other Emperors, he too...

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.730
...has been manipulated by Don Thousand.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:43.610
Ridiculous... That's so ridiculous...

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:48.450
That just now... were my true memories from when I was a human...

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.990
Then... all has been a lie?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.870
That I slaughtered my parents...

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.670
If that's the case... then I...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.170
Then I ...!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.170
Don Thousand!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:06.470
It seems you've noticed the truth, right?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.510
You son of a bitch, you... You betrayed me!?

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.060
Vector...

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.310
How terrible...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.360
Don Thousand! Because of you,

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:31.780
Vector's heart... his heart has been broken!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.080
Aren't such feelings just natural after all he's been through?

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.580
Vector, you originally were

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.250
a nice and kind guy!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:43.090
Like as you appeared in front of me as Shingetsu Rei.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:46.590
That's who you are!

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:51.800
That's the one you really are!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:56.640
Shingetsu... Shingetsu is... my true self...

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.560
Tsukumo Yuma.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.690
Vector was a perfect toy.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:07.610
The purer a heart, the greater the backlash from the darkness born inside.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.820
Thus allowing him to be reborn as an incredibly strong Barian.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:17.330
If you hadn't screwed with his memories, Vector would have been a kind prince!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:22.580
But, the cruel, sadistic actions of this man still remain fact.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.170
They can't be erased.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:30.680
Right... the crimes I did in my past will not disappear...

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.970
Vector, you can start over, again!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.430
That's right.Even if you can't erase the past,

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.430
you can paint a new future!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.100
Thank you, Yuma, Kotori.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.270
But I...  cannot have a future anymore.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.900
For someone like me, who's tormented Nasch and you all so much...

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.070
...the future is...

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:59.120
Trap Card activate! "Xyz Discharge"!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.330
This card, at the cost of my opponent discarding a card,

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.500
hands over every Xyz Monster I control...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.750
...to my opponent!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.260
What did you say?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.010
What are you up to!?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.930
Nasch, this is my way of making up...!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.220
Use these monsters to strike me down!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.680
Vector!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:24.730
Bury Don Thousand while he's still inside of me!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.310
You damn bastard!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.400
You want to go down with him together?!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.280
Stop, Vector!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.190
I'm begging you... I...

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:36.240
Get rid of me along with my dirty past, please!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.160
I won't allow it!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.160
You insolent trickster...!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.000
Quick! While I'm able to stop him!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.760
Nasch, I beg you!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.090
Understood.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:57.470
Shark!

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.600
Due to Xyz Discharge's effect,

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.100
I'll send "Dream Shark" from my hand to the Graveyard!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:09.270
With that, I gain control of all of your monsters!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.110
Come on, do it, Nasch!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.740
Wait, Shark! Vector is...!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:21.120
Yuma, there is no other... this is the only...

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.200
Vector...

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.830
You...

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.250
Do it! Nasch!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.170
Ragna Infinity...

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.630
Stop it!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.760
Attack him directly!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.140
VECTOR!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.360
I activate a Trap! "Trick Buster"!

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:56.610
With this card, when I get attacked while only my opponent controls monsters,

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.030
that attack is negated,

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:05.000
and all the opponent's Attack Position monsters are destroyed!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.250
Disappear!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.260
That's...

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.470
Gotcha!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.350
What do you mean, Vector?

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.310
I've pulled a double-headed specter! You saw it!


00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.310
<i>(TL: Doumokoumo is a double headed, disturbed specter in Japanese legends.)</i>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.690
I caught you all with it!

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.940
With my supreme acting of myself!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.360
You idiots. To think, I got you on the hook and duped you.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.490
A bunch of hopelessly naГЇve guys, that's what you are.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.740
Vector!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.620
Now, Nasch.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.590
Now, let me send you to where your friends went.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.670
But first,

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.300
maybe I should get rid of a certain meddling "God", first...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.300
What do you mean, Vector?

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:05.260
I noticed a <i>long</i> time ago.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:10.060
That you had toyed with the memories of my past.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:14.940
Then, you intended to show all this to us...?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:19.400
Yeah, you know, seeing you all suffering like that,

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.490
it's so damn entertaining!

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.240
That's...

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:27.910
But that about you bastard playing around with my memories...

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.620
... that <i>really</i> pissed me off.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.960
Vector, you cannot possibly raise a hand against me!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.210
YOU SHUT UP!

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.420
With the power from the other Seven Emperors,

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.930
I have way more power than you bastard now!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.560
You idiot, Vector!

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.350
For you to have so much power...

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.270
VECTOOooor!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.160
He obliterated Don Thousand...?

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.620
Now for you, Nasch. You're next!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.500
My Trick Buster's effect ain't over yet.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.210
For each monster it destroys,

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.840
you'll take 300 points o' damage!

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:21.670
Since three went down,
you'll be taking 900 points of damage!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.050
So long, Nasch!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.390
Shark!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.060
I activate the effect of my "Dream Shark"!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.060
It negates this Effect Damage,

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.640
and then Special Summons itself from the Graveyard in Defense Position.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:36.310
What did you say!?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.820
You son of a... You didn't believe me!?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.110
"Believe"?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:49.080
I threw away those emotions, together with my memories from when I was a human.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:50.950
Shark...

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.500
I set 2 cards and end my turn.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:59.210
Nasch, you... I won't forgive this!

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:03.130
Behold, my true power!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.880
My turn, draw!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.550
Let's go...

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:12.390
Rank-Up Magic "Admire Death Thousand", activate!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:16.480
Of the Chaos Numbers of the same Rank in either player's graveyards, this card...

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.610
lets me chose as much as I need,

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:22.690
and revives them as monsters whose Level is plus 1 to what their Rank was.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.700
And now, Dark Knight, Umbral,

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.780
Noble Daemon, Ragna Infinity!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:34.790
I can then Summon an Xyz Monster using them all!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:41.420
I overlay these 4 Level 6 monsters together!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:45.090
Direct Chaos Xyz Change!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.930
Show yourself, Chaos Number 5!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.930
Let even the World of the Dead become Chaos!

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:59.060
Now let the souls dissolve into one and descend to this lowly world of filth!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.900
Chaos Chimera Dragon the Grave Mound Dragon!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.030
Take a good look, Nasch.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:13.700
This guy was made by combining the power of Chaos from your <i>dear</i> friends!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.870
Now, let's go!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.750
For each Chaos Overlay Unit attached, Chaos Chimera Dragon...

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.250
gains 1000 Attack!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:28.510
And now, I activate Chaos Chimera Dragon's effect!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.850
As this guy can't attack normally,

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.680
I have to detach 1 Xyz Material from this card,

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.390
then from the opponent's deck...

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.440
one card will be banished randomly,

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.100
so it can attack!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.730
Of course, if I would use one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.900
it does lose 1000 Attack,

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.860
but that's more than enough to defeat you!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.280
Nasch!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:54.910
Chaos Chimera Dragon, attack Dream Shark!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.120
I activate the effect of "Dream Shark"!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:01.670
Once per turn, I can lower its Defense by 1000 Points,

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:04.500
to negate an instance of destruction caused by battle!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.460
I'm not done yet!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.510
I activate the effect of "Chaos Chimera Dragon"!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.300
By using one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:16.810
I can banish one card from my opponent's Deck and attack again!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.070
When Dream Shark is destroyed,

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.240
it's banished instead of being sent to the Graveyard.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.570
With that, your monsters are all gone!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.870
I activate the effect of "Chaos Chimera Dragon"!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:41.120
After banishing the card from your Deck, it attacks!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.920
When Chaos Chimera Dragon attacks directly,

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.550
its Attack is halved, but that's more than enough!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.220
Thanks for entertaining me!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.300
You are the best fun toy I have ever played!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.180
But now you're just an eyesore!

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:59.480
The same to you, Vector!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.020
Well then, Nasch!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.980
This time, you're finished!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.980
Chaos Chimera Dragon, attack directly!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.030
Shark!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.990
Trap activate, "Depth Gardna"!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.450
When I take an attack directly...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.170
That battle damage is negated,

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:29.090
and this card is Special Summoned as a Level 5 monster!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.090
And that monster's ATK is

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:38.180
the same as the damage I would of taken!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.100
Nasch, I'll teach you..

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.640
... teach you, teach you, teach you!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.770
I activate Chaos Chimera Dragon's <i>other</i> effect!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:51.990
After this card battles, the cards it has banished return to the top of the opponent's deck!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.830
I set 1 card and end my turn!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.080
<i>Why would those banished cards...</i>

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.120
My turn, draw!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.040
Vector!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:12.210
I will end you with the card you foolishly placed back on top of my Deck!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:15.630
Too bad! That's impossible!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:16.970
What?

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.260
Those Cards from Chaos Chimera Dragon's effect,

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:23.810
each of those banished cards can no longer be used during this Duel!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.560
But, that means...

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.190
This is bad, Yuma!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:32.280
With this, Shark's next three draws are sealed.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:36.410
And now, I activate yet another effect of my Chaos Chimera Dragon!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.030
During my opponent's turn,

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.370
I can pay half my Life Points,

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:44.290
to reattach every Xyz Material I used during my last turn!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.210
Thus its Attack returns to 4000!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:54.130
That's bad! That way when Vector's next turn comes...

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:56.680
It will be the same Attack as before...

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.140
You get it, Nasch!?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:03.270
This time, it's <i>really</i> over for you!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:08.940
It may be ironic, but the one you helped with this seems to be <i>me</i>.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:15.070
I activate the Spell Card "Infinity Tooth" from my hand!

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:18.570
Equal to the number of Overlay Units my opponent's monsters possess

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.580
I can send cards from the top of my Deck to the Graveyard!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.750
Therefore, I send the top 4 cards of my Deck to the Graveyard!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.910
The forbidden cards!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.500
And then I draw 1 new card!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.250
Barian's Chaos Draw!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.880
I Normal Summon "Depth Biter"!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.890
When there is an Xyz-Monster on the opponent's field,

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.220
this guy can be summoned without a tribute!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:47.930
I Overlay my Level 5 Depth Gardna and Depth Biter!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.940
Xyz Summon!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.400
Show yourself, Number 73!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:59.110
Abyss Splash the Roaring Waterfall Deity!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.580
I activate the effect of Abyss Splash!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.290
By using 1 Xyz Material,

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.670
until the Battle ends, its Attack is doubled!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.960
Go, Abyss Splash!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.470
Attack his Chaos Chimera Dragon!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.970
Naive! Too naive! That's what you are!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:26.260
Counter Trap Card "Overlay Burglary"!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:32.150
This card, when my Xyz Monster receives an attack from an opposing Xyz Monster,

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:37.230
I can snatch one of that monster's Overlay Units and attach it to mine!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:42.030
With this, my Chaos Chimera Dragon's Attack rises by 1000!

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:48.410
Had you used both of your monster's Overlay Units,

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:52.120
You would have won, you know? Such a pity!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.420
As it stands...

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.880
Shark'll lose!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:20:00.300
Now, let the battle continue! Byebye, Nasch!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.510
It's over for <i>you</i>, bastard!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:03.680
What?!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:08.640
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Card "Rank-Up-Magic Quick Chaos"!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.890
A Quick-Play "Rank-Up-Magic", you said?!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:15.860
With this card, I chose one Xyz Monster I control,

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.320
chaosify it and rank it up!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.740
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:27.200
Show yourself, Chaos Number 73!

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:34.830
Pierce through the Whirlpool of Chaos, to surface here from the depths!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:38.750
Abyss Supra the Roaring Waterfall Deity!

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.090
This guy will bury you in the darkness!

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:50.220
Abyss Supra, attack Chaos Chimera Dragon!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.140
It only has 3000 Attack! That costs your own head!

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.560
I activate Abyss Supra's effect!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:01.530
When this monster battles, it can use 1 Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:06.030
to gain Attack equal to the Attack of an opponent's monster it battles!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.030
Wha- what!?

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:12.120
Chaos Chimera Dragon currently has 5000 Attack!

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:17.080
Thus my Abyss Supra gains 5000 Attack!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.880
That's 8000 Attack!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.260
Vector...

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:27.470
... Now fall into the lightless Dark with that evil soul of yours!

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:32.020
Damn bastard...! Nasch!

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:34.770
Turn into dust! Vector!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:54.620
It can't be... I...

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:57.120
That means, I lost!?

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.260
{marker}

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.890
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:16.310
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.600
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.270
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:24.860
Let it go.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:38.160
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.380
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.300
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.640
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.440
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.360
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:07.530
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.910
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.790
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.540
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:22.000
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.130
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.960
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.380
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.890
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:45.270
It was unavoidable. The Barian World has completed the fusion with Earth.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.110
Finally, the Numeron Code would be released.

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:53.280
In front of revived Don Thousand, do we still have ways to counterattack?

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:55.830
Let's start over again, Shingetsu!

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.160
That's useless! You will get sucked in as well!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:00.500
<i>Kattobingu da, ore!!</i>

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.870
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZeXaL II!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.960
"A Being of Chaos - "Don Thousand" Emerges!!"

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:08.670
I absolutely will not forgive you, Don Thousand!
